# The compilation directory created by EiffelStudio (e.g. project/EIFGENs).
# A bare name pattern (no leading or trailing slash) matches the directory at
# any depth in the repository tree, so EIFGENs/, src/EIFGENs/, and
# a/b/EIFGENs/ are all ignored. Files contained within any matched directory
# are implicitly ignored too. Names that merely start with or contain the
# string "EIFGENs" (e.g. EIFGENs-backup, EIFGENs_extra) are NOT matched.
EIFGENs
